# The repository stores LF and every desk checks out LF, so nothing converts and
# nothing warns. `core.autocrlf=true` on a Windows desk rewrote all 294 text files
# on checkout and back on commit, which `git diff` normalised to nothing while
# `git status` still called them modified.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.zst binary
*.usdc binary
